{"author":{"id":"038d65070aa747b6bc9d50939fa697ec871a40ed259db54429b255bbef2581d6"},"ops":[{"type":3,"timestamp":1792955198,"nonce":"hPEFz4B71tULjaTPVWZgsN3RkQQ=","message":"The full RayDE WASM page now mounts a real session selected with ?session=ws(s)://.../session\u0026project=build.hxml#token=..., through Ash's ash-channel page agent. No direct sys.net.Socket polling in the browser. Page settings and sample files persist through IndexedDB.\n\nSessionClient multiplexes ash.Future RPCs; one receiver, one serialized writer and a sleeping deadline worker. Program startup/writes/kills are asynchronous, stream readers wake from futures, response/error/timeout/disconnect paths settle pending requests, and bounded queues prevent unbounded buffering. Fast child output before spawn registration is retained. Native WebSocket/framed workspace and program conformance still pass; SessionAsyncChecks covers out-of-order replies, blocked writer deadlines, remote errors, early process output and close.\n\nBrowser idle revealed an upstream integration gap: the window's native wait did not poll registered Ash page watches. Runtime host_wait now polls page completions; the page window observes the runtime wake word and wakes only for changed work; hlwindow prepares/resumes Ash's scheduler around its browser wait. Tracked in Ash d5c1450, xwindow dc697b0 and hlwindow b8470e4. Exact typing checks also found key text duplicated by IME commits, tracked in xwindow 7b836ee.\n\nThe full browser check reads a \u003e1 MB remote file, runs a supervised RayScript extension on the session machine, carries Unicode across process/ring boundaries and invokes its workspace service in the page. Verified with the full page in headless Chrome using three agents: exact edit/save reached the session file; the large remote read and Unicode extension workspace call completed without input; zero extra GPU submissions during the 1.5-second idle sample and zero cross-batch submissions after editing. The local sample and platform command shortcut also passed. RayDE commit 7e0ceed07615b029046bcbe8a9f8775b10fd1a28. Prerequisites are the current ash-channel checkout and matching newly built Ash/window WASM libraries; these dependency changes are local and not published.\n\nRemote LSP transport, PTYs, full-editor Yjs binding and hosted Cloudflare/account flows remain separate open tracks. Do not infer completion of the entire browser epic from this bridge.","files":null}]}